16:43.720 --> 16:44.280
Really?

16:44.320 --> 16:45.280
Yes, wanna see?

16:45.280 --> 16:46.160
Oh, yeah, sure.

16:46.560 --> 16:47.800
Showtime, Big G.

16:51.520 --> 16:52.280
Hello everyone.

16:52.400 --> 16:53.800
My name is Fan Tong.

16:53.800 --> 16:54.960
You can call me Big G.

16:55.400 --> 16:56.480
It means fat tiger,

16:56.520 --> 16:58.040
but I'm not fat as you can see.

16:58.200 --> 16:59.480
I'll show you

16:59.600 --> 17:02.240
how we learn English with joy in rap.

17:04.280 --> 17:06.119
1, 2, 3, go!

17:06.200 --> 17:06.880
Yo, welcome to

17:06.920 --> 17:08.079
a class

17:08.079 --> 17:09.240
that is super fun,

17:09.240 --> 17:10.280
learning with a beat,

17:10.319 --> 17:11.480
yeah, we've just begun!

17:11.480 --> 17:12.319
Take the root "act,"

17:12.480 --> 17:13.599
play it like a game,

17:13.640 --> 17:14.720
watch how it changes, never stays the same.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.280
I'm on stage performing,

17:16.319 --> 17:17.200
an "actor" too,

17:17.200 --> 17:18.400
but if I "overact,"

17:18.400 --> 17:19.400
it's a bit too much for you!

17:19.480 --> 17:21.319
Boring study methods

17:21.480 --> 17:22.520
"counteract" the fun,

17:22.520 --> 17:23.839
so let's "interact" together, everyone!

17:26.839 --> 17:27.480
Thank you!

17:30.200 --> 17:31.480
Oh, I'm really amazed by

17:31.520 --> 17:33.000
the English proficiency of

17:33.040 --> 17:33.880
the students here

17:34.320 --> 17:36.080
and by the

17:36.120 --> 17:37.240
educational concepts.

17:37.680 --> 17:39.520
We can talk about collaboration later.

17:41.600 --> 17:42.160
OK!

17:56.200 --> 17:56.960
Go go go!

17:57.200 --> 17:57.920
Bribble!

17:59.880 --> 18:00.560
Do you like it?

18:00.800 --> 18:02.880
I really love playing basketball, y'know?

18:02.960 --> 18:03.800
You wanna try?

18:06.760 --> 18:07.280
OK.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.000
Have a try!

18:08.280 --> 18:08.880
Thank you!

18:10.040 --> 18:10.560
Let's go!

18:16.240 --> 18:18.480
OK, now it's lunch time.

18:18.480 --> 18:20.480
So let's go to the restaurant to eat.

18:20.600 --> 18:21.640
Sure.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.200
Let's go.

18:22.280 --> 18:23.560
This way.

18:23.560 --> 18:25.640
I really, really like Chinese food.

18:32.400 --> 18:33.600
Ye Yingjian is really something!

18:34.000 --> 18:34.800
Look at all these awards.

18:52.280 --> 18:53.520
He's almost as good as you, Wu.

19:16.200 --> 19:16.920
Hands off!

19:20.920 --> 19:21.560
Xing Wu,

19:22.000 --> 19:22.600
see if we can use

19:22.600 --> 19:23.520
any of these light tubes.

19:24.080 --> 19:24.640
Be right there.

19:28.280 --> 19:29.400
Look here!

19:30.600 --> 19:33.960
Hey, you two stand in the middle, please.

19:34.480 --> 19:35.160
Yeah, come on!

19:35.320 --> 19:37.120
I'm really happy.

19:37.160 --> 19:37.840
Thank you.

19:37.840 --> 19:38.320
Thank you.

19:39.000 --> 19:39.360
Please!

19:40.320 --> 19:40.920
Thank you so much!

19:40.920 --> 19:41.960
Alright, eyes on the camera.

19:42.240 --> 19:44.480
1, 2, 3, cheese!

19:53.240 --> 19:53.720
Good to go.

19:54.320 --> 19:55.120
That was fast!

19:55.680 --> 19:56.720
First time fixing a fish tank,

19:56.800 --> 19:57.800
and you beat your AC record!

19:59.200 --> 19:59.880
Pack up.

20:00.480 --> 20:01.120
Xing Wu,

20:02.040 --> 20:02.760
you're the real deal.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.520
Hit me up if it acts up again.

20:04.840 --> 20:05.360
Got it.

20:06.600 --> 20:07.200
Mr. Jiang,

20:08.240 --> 20:09.600
I hear you,

20:10.600 --> 20:11.240
It's not

20:11.560 --> 20:12.800
a lack of interest,

20:13.160 --> 20:14.000
I just don't

20:14.040 --> 20:15.040
have the right project now.

20:17.120 --> 20:17.680
Got it working?

20:20.040 --> 20:21.480
Yeah, sure.

20:21.840 --> 20:22.760
Let's touch base later.

20:23.800 --> 20:24.360
Alright.

20:24.520 --> 20:25.120
Talk soon!

20:27.280 --> 20:28.120
So, you're Xing Wu?

20:29.160 --> 20:29.840
Hello, Mr. Ye.

20:30.480 --> 20:31.040
Hey.

20:31.480 --> 20:33.040
She said you're a genius,

20:33.400 --> 20:34.800
better than the certified techs.

20:34.880 --> 20:35.560
Honestly, I didn't buy it.

20:36.400 --> 20:37.160
All machines are

20:37.360 --> 20:38.080
similar anyway.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.280
I heard you did

20:41.400 --> 20:42.400
a great job in Xinhai, too.

20:43.400 --> 20:44.560
You look around

20:44.560 --> 20:45.080
my son's age.

20:45.600 --> 20:46.480
Why aren't you in school?

20:48.920 --> 20:49.680
I wanted to make money.

20:50.280 --> 20:51.040
Money?

20:52.280 --> 20:53.200
Why is that?

20:54.160 --> 20:55.200
Everyone needs money, right?

20:58.280 --> 20:59.600
Sorry, gotta take this.

21:01.440 --> 21:01.920
Hey,

21:02.440 --> 21:02.920
Mr. Ma!

21:03.200 --> 21:03.760
Dude,

21:04.360 --> 21:05.080
I think

21:05.240 --> 21:06.480
he really likes you.

21:06.880 --> 21:07.480
Big congrats.

21:07.720 --> 21:09.240
Another big shot likes you.

21:09.840 --> 21:11.240
I only care about the paycheck.

21:19.920 --> 21:21.240
He thinks very highly of you.

21:21.800 --> 21:22.560
He's launching

21:22.560 --> 21:23.960
a project on tech street,

21:24.440 --> 21:25.320
and wanted me to ask

21:25.480 --> 21:26.280
if you'd like

21:26.320 --> 21:27.160
to run it.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.280
See?

21:28.480 --> 21:29.840
I told you so.

21:30.840 --> 21:32.280
He loved that

21:32.280 --> 21:33.280
batch of PCs you flipped

21:33.400 --> 21:34.320
in Xinhai.

21:34.520 --> 21:35.840
He's had you on his radar since then.

21:36.800 --> 21:37.600
We barely talked

21:37.600 --> 21:38.480
for three minutes.

21:39.000 --> 21:40.000
That's all it takes.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.080
He's been

21:41.080 --> 21:42.120
in the game forever,

21:42.520 --> 21:43.520
his eye is sharp.

21:44.360 --> 21:45.080
Honestly,

21:45.680 --> 21:46.360
if he hands you

21:46.360 --> 21:47.760
this opportunity...

21:48.320 --> 21:49.000
what's your move?

21:51.120 --> 21:51.840
What's the package?

21:52.120 --> 21:52.720
Dude,

21:53.200 --> 21:55.000
running the whole tech street?

21:55.320 --> 21:57.200
That's a total goldmine!

21:58.080 --> 22:00.320
It's a highly coveted spot.

22:00.640 --> 22:01.520
Even Yang Gang

22:01.840 --> 22:03.320
has his eye on it.

22:05.800 --> 22:07.240
I gotta see how big the bag is

22:07.560 --> 22:08.720
before I make a move.

22:09.920 --> 22:11.760
Nine-k base, fat commissions,

22:12.080 --> 22:12.920
and full insurance.

22:13.240 --> 22:14.040
Stick around

22:14.360 --> 22:15.920
for three years,

22:16.160 --> 22:17.520
and he will let you

22:17.840 --> 22:19.120
buy a store for dirt cheap.

22:19.880 --> 22:20.560
Plus,

22:20.880 --> 22:21.560
he's in

22:21.560 --> 22:22.640
real estate now,

22:23.000 --> 22:23.800
so you might

22:24.040 --> 22:25.080
even score a free condo!

22:31.320 --> 22:33.280
[I want us to]

22:33.280 --> 22:35.080
[make memories in school,]

22:35.520 --> 22:36.760
[get out of this town,]

22:37.480 --> 22:38.720
[and welcome a dazzling future together.]

22:45.560 --> 22:47.200
Seriously sleeping on an offer like this?

22:47.280 --> 22:48.480
When should I set up

22:48.480 --> 22:48.960
your meeting?

22:51.520 --> 22:52.120
Make it quick.

22:52.920 --> 22:53.400
You got it!

23:02.960 --> 23:03.560
Seriously,

23:04.160 --> 23:04.880
why does she

23:04.880 --> 23:06.560
get all the attention?

23:08.000 --> 23:09.400
Because she's actually good.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.520
You're taking her side?

23:11.800 --> 23:13.200
Did you hit your head?

23:13.360 --> 23:14.200
Yeah, girl,

23:14.560 --> 23:15.280
she stepped all over you,

23:15.280 --> 23:16.120
and you're still defending her?

23:18.080 --> 23:19.360
She's a rich

23:19.680 --> 23:20.280
city girl

23:20.320 --> 23:21.400
with connections.

23:22.040 --> 23:23.200
She outclassed me, period.

23:23.280 --> 23:23.840
I'm over it.

23:24.560 --> 23:26.080
That should've been your moment!

23:26.360 --> 23:27.600
If she didn't butt in,

23:27.880 --> 23:29.000
you'd be the one flexing

23:29.000 --> 23:30.280
next to Ye Yingjian in that photo.

23:32.080 --> 23:33.680
Average girls like us

23:33.960 --> 23:35.000
don't stand a chance.

23:35.360 --> 23:36.640
Even if we try our hardest,

23:36.640 --> 23:37.800
we're not even in her league.

23:39.040 --> 23:40.200
I can't stand her

23:40.200 --> 23:41.480
high-and-mighty act.

23:41.880 --> 23:42.720
She's barely here

23:42.720 --> 23:43.800
and she's hogging the spotlight.

23:45.000 --> 23:45.840
Chill the f*ck out!

23:47.120 --> 23:48.640
She's got the receipts, though.

23:49.760 --> 23:50.600
Well, you can take it,

23:51.080 --> 23:51.800
but I won't!

24:01.040 --> 24:01.560
Qing Ye,

24:02.320 --> 24:03.040
I was looking for you.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.040
Mr. Zhu.

24:04.920 --> 24:05.560
Here.

24:06.080 --> 24:06.800
What's this?

24:07.200 --> 24:07.840
Your prize money,

24:07.880 --> 24:08.680
as promised.

24:09.120 --> 24:09.560
For making

24:09.560 --> 24:10.760
us proud.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.400
Thank you, sir!

24:14.760 --> 24:15.400
Listen,

24:16.000 --> 24:17.200
we don't have

24:17.520 --> 24:18.760
the fancy resources

24:18.800 --> 24:19.680
of a big city school,

24:20.040 --> 24:21.040
but if you grind,

24:21.360 --> 24:22.320
we've

24:22.400 --> 24:23.480
got your back!

24:23.840 --> 24:24.320
Got it.

24:24.680 --> 24:25.080
Cool.

24:25.320 --> 24:25.600
Catch you later.

24:25.600 --> 24:26.160
See ya.

24:44.480 --> 24:46.160
Guess who just got her prize money?

24:48.600 --> 24:49.120
[Congrats.]

24:51.560 --> 24:52.880
See?

24:52.880 --> 24:54.200
I can help carry

24:54.200 --> 24:55.240
the financial load now.

24:56.160 --> 24:57.240
Totally found money!

24:57.920 --> 24:58.480
So...

24:58.840 --> 25:00.480
ready to join me yet?

25:04.280 --> 25:04.960
[It's not "found money."]

25:05.200 --> 25:06.160
[You earned it.]

25:09.520 --> 25:10.480
[An interpreter would've]

25:10.640 --> 25:11.400
[charged them double.]

25:35.600 --> 25:36.320
You guys want something?

25:37.200 --> 25:37.840
Look,

25:37.920 --> 25:39.920
here's your welcome gift!

25:40.440 --> 25:41.320
Prickly things

25:41.760 --> 25:43.400
for little pricks!

25:48.080 --> 25:49.280
One? Please!

25:50.920 --> 25:51.840
Dang! The whole stash!

25:56.080 --> 25:58.320
Enjoy the whole pack!

26:32.440 --> 26:33.840
Yo, school over?

26:34.400 --> 26:34.840
[Man,]

26:35.040 --> 26:36.120
[Big G and I got benched]

26:36.120 --> 26:37.040
[to finish our homework.]

26:37.560 --> 26:38.160
Is Qing Ye with you?

26:39.560 --> 26:40.840
[Nah, she split early.]

26:41.440 --> 26:43.000
[Ain't she home yet?]

26:54.120 --> 26:54.920
[ETA?]

26:56.560 --> 26:57.560
[Gotta skip]

26:57.560 --> 26:58.360
[Mr. Ye's dinner.]

26:58.600 --> 26:59.800
[I'll apologize in person.]

27:20.280 --> 27:20.880
Qing Ye!

27:22.320 --> 27:22.960
Where've you been?

27:24.000 --> 27:25.160
Why are you ignoring my calls?

27:26.480 --> 27:27.640
My phone was on silent.

27:45.080 --> 27:45.720
Who did this?

27:47.640 --> 27:48.280
Does it matter?

28:09.640 --> 28:10.280
Drop the scissor.

28:26.920 --> 28:27.400
Lean back.

28:56.200 --> 28:56.840
Does it hurt?

28:59.520 --> 29:00.280
Are you serious?

29:04.000 --> 29:05.120
It's fine.

29:06.120 --> 29:07.400
I just want these awful things

29:07.400 --> 29:08.400
out of my life forever.

29:19.200 --> 29:20.120
Any bruises?

29:21.920 --> 29:22.520
No.

29:24.040 --> 29:24.680
Are you capping?

29:29.520 --> 29:30.280
I'm not...

29:34.880 --> 29:35.520
Alright.

29:38.760 --> 29:39.440
Seriously...

29:41.000 --> 29:42.200
come back to school.

29:51.600 --> 29:53.000
With you around,

29:54.560 --> 29:56.000
no one would dare touch me.

30:01.200 --> 30:02.640
What makes you think that?

30:05.760 --> 30:07.000
Because you're literally

30:07.000 --> 30:07.840
a legend there.

30:08.840 --> 30:09.840
My friend Shi Min

30:10.440 --> 30:11.160
was hyping you up

30:11.160 --> 30:12.240
so hard.

30:13.200 --> 30:15.360
If you had my back,

30:16.120 --> 30:17.600
those toxic girls

30:18.520 --> 30:19.840
wouldn't dare pull this cr*p.

30:24.360 --> 30:25.720
Not even if... It's to protect me?

31:19.840 --> 31:21.000
Go dry your hair.

31:21.720 --> 31:22.400
Gotta be somewhere.

31:27.040 --> 31:27.640
Xing Wu!

31:37.680 --> 31:38.360
Yo,

31:39.040 --> 31:40.720
getting kept everyday is wild!

31:40.920 --> 31:42.000
Like, I have a life!

31:45.320 --> 31:46.040
Honestly,

31:46.640 --> 31:47.600
college is

31:47.600 --> 31:48.520
a scam anyway!

31:48.640 --> 31:49.560
I should just pull a Wu:

31:49.880 --> 31:50.720
hustle, grind,

31:50.720 --> 31:51.560
and get my bread!

31:51.720 --> 31:53.840
You got zero resume.

31:54.120 --> 31:55.920
Hey! I've got skills!

31:56.240 --> 31:56.640
Well...

31:56.680 --> 31:57.200
Is it good?

31:58.800 --> 31:59.440
Wu?

31:59.920 --> 32:00.680
Yo, what's up?

32:01.200 --> 32:02.360
Qing Ye home?

32:04.840 --> 32:05.360
Yeah.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.960
You hungry? Want one?

32:10.520 --> 32:11.360
Real talk.

32:12.160 --> 32:13.320
How's she doing at school?

32:14.600 --> 32:15.040
Oh, wow!

32:15.600 --> 32:16.440
She's thriving!

32:16.720 --> 32:17.080
Literally

32:17.080 --> 32:18.080
a main character!

32:21.280 --> 32:22.280
Has she

32:23.400 --> 32:24.200
pissed anyone off?

32:27.360 --> 32:27.960
Doubt it...

32:29.040 --> 32:30.080
She's just been

32:30.160 --> 32:31.520
flexing too hard lately!

32:31.760 --> 32:33.240
During the VIP visit,

32:33.360 --> 32:34.240
she was hosting

32:34.600 --> 32:36.120
the whole thing

32:36.120 --> 32:36.880
in flawless English!

32:37.040 --> 32:37.760
We were basically

32:37.760 --> 32:38.840
NPCs in the back

32:39.200 --> 32:40.120
going, "Welcome! Welcome!"

32:40.320 --> 32:41.680
She's got crazy clout

32:41.680 --> 32:42.240
now.

32:42.920 --> 32:43.840
Did something happen to her?

32:46.680 --> 32:47.200
Nothing.

32:48.000 --> 32:48.600
Just asking.

32:50.200 --> 32:51.360
Relax, dude.

32:51.440 --> 32:52.480
She ain't no

32:52.840 --> 32:53.880
pushover.

32:53.880 --> 32:54.520
She can

32:54.520 --> 32:55.520
handle herself.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.200
But real talk,

32:58.280 --> 32:59.600
clout brings haters.

33:00.720 --> 33:02.120
A few girls

33:02.920 --> 33:04.160
are definitely salty...

33:06.120 --> 33:06.640
Who are they?

33:07.080 --> 33:08.480
Ye-Ye is a straight-A student

33:08.480 --> 33:09.400
and a total ten.

33:09.800 --> 33:11.120
If I were a gal, I'd be pressed!

33:16.000 --> 33:16.840
I want names.

33:30.360 --> 33:31.880
You take after your mom.

33:33.600 --> 33:34.400
Most people say

33:34.440 --> 33:35.680
I got my dad's face.

33:38.000 --> 33:39.360
Nonsense.

33:39.920 --> 33:40.760
Your mom and I were

33:40.760 --> 33:41.840
inseparable for ten years.

33:42.360 --> 33:43.480
You're a carbon copy

33:43.480 --> 33:44.200
of her young self.

33:46.600 --> 33:48.120
Why'd you ghost her?

33:51.960 --> 33:53.240
I got knocked up

33:53.560 --> 33:54.560
before marriage!

34:00.560 --> 34:02.720
I was adopted by

34:02.800 --> 34:03.440
your grandparents,

34:04.560 --> 34:06.000
living under their roof.

34:06.000 --> 34:06.960
When I messed up,

34:07.240 --> 34:08.000
I couldn't face them,

34:08.560 --> 34:10.280
so I just dipped.

34:13.480 --> 34:14.600
Do you miss her?

34:16.400 --> 34:16.920
Oh,

34:17.639 --> 34:18.320
hell yeah.

34:19.239 --> 34:20.000
But I never

34:20.000 --> 34:20.880
reached out.

34:22.520 --> 34:23.639
One wrong step

34:23.679 --> 34:25.040
and it's

34:26.120 --> 34:27.239
a slippery slope.

34:34.719 --> 34:35.840
My husband

34:36.920 --> 34:37.840
left us,

34:38.800 --> 34:39.600
my mother-in-law is paralyzed,

34:40.560 --> 34:41.280
my boy dropped out,

34:41.280 --> 34:42.639
and we're broke.

34:43.440 --> 34:44.480
But we're

34:44.639 --> 34:45.440
still breathing, right?

34:46.199 --> 34:48.280
Every day above ground is a win!

34:50.920 --> 34:51.719
Auntie,

34:52.840 --> 34:53.960
I love your optimism.

34:54.239 --> 34:55.000
Right?

34:55.280 --> 34:56.120
My positive vibe

34:56.120 --> 34:57.240
is my superpower!

34:57.920 --> 34:59.040
What's that

34:59.040 --> 35:00.240
Gen-Z term again?

35:00.840 --> 35:02.560
"A happy little puppy!"

35:04.240 --> 35:04.880
At the end

35:04.880 --> 35:06.400
of the day,

35:07.040 --> 35:08.480
it's all about

35:08.600 --> 35:09.600
staying positive!

35:13.640 --> 35:14.320
Auntie,

35:15.200 --> 35:16.560
don't you want

35:17.720 --> 35:19.680
Wu to have a real chance?

35:24.520 --> 35:25.480
Schopenhauer said,

35:26.040 --> 35:29.160
"fate shuffles the cards

35:29.680 --> 35:31.040
and we play."

35:31.840 --> 35:32.760
We can actually

35:33.120 --> 35:35.040
choose how to play.

35:35.880 --> 35:36.720
You have to

35:36.720 --> 35:37.960
play smart.

35:38.760 --> 35:40.280
If we just drift along,

35:40.280 --> 35:41.160
nothing changes.

35:42.080 --> 35:43.680
Why not take a leap of faith

35:44.240 --> 35:46.000
and break free?

35:48.560 --> 35:49.200
Sweetie...

35:50.520 --> 35:51.880
This Schopenhauer guy...

35:53.240 --> 35:56.480
sounds like a total card shark.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.560
Does he play blackjack?

36:05.200 --> 36:05.880
I bet he

36:07.960 --> 36:09.000
cleans up at the casino!

36:35.960 --> 36:36.560
Xing Wu...

37:34.240 --> 37:35.560
Maid service already?

37:38.600 --> 37:40.040
In your head!

37:41.160 --> 37:41.680
I'm just...

37:43.600 --> 37:45.120
browsing...

37:45.320 --> 37:47.880
Your handwriting's actually neat.

37:48.400 --> 37:50.480
And you're surprisingly

37:50.760 --> 37:52.400
good at math.

37:53.520 --> 37:54.000
That's it.

37:56.760 --> 37:57.480
It was nothing.

37:59.040 --> 37:59.840
Total flex.

38:04.520 --> 38:04.960
You gotta learn to

38:04.960 --> 38:06.120
handle yourself around here.

38:09.520 --> 38:10.280
Let me teach you a move.

38:12.160 --> 38:13.560
It better be a cheat code.

38:13.760 --> 38:14.920
I don't do basic tier.

38:16.600 --> 38:17.080
You bet.

38:18.560 --> 38:19.000
Now.

38:20.000 --> 38:20.480
Come at me.

38:23.160 --> 38:24.040
How?

38:24.480 --> 38:25.080
Any way.

38:25.680 --> 38:26.600
Go for the kill.

38:57.080 --> 38:58.440
Ow, ow!

39:00.800 --> 39:01.880
Seriously?

39:02.720 --> 39:04.040
This is your cheat code?

39:05.640 --> 39:06.760
The lesson is,

39:07.840 --> 39:08.560
fighting back blindly

39:08.560 --> 39:09.400
when you're cornered

39:09.880 --> 39:11.200
is a rookie mistake.

39:40.120 --> 39:40.600
It's...

39:40.640 --> 39:42.120
a gag gift from years ago.

39:44.080 --> 39:45.080
How sweet.

39:47.440 --> 39:48.120
Anyway,

39:48.760 --> 39:49.600
my point is...

39:50.280 --> 39:51.080
there is no

39:51.080 --> 39:51.920
cheat code

39:51.920 --> 39:52.640
for self-defense.

39:53.080 --> 39:53.720
Technique

39:53.720 --> 39:54.800
gets crushed

39:55.080 --> 39:56.040
by raw power.

39:56.600 --> 39:57.280
Case in point.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.400
So I'm just helpless?

40:00.960 --> 40:01.600
Run.

40:02.560 --> 40:04.000
Rule number one: book it.

40:04.360 --> 40:05.640
Run like your life depends on it.

40:08.200 --> 40:08.840
Lecture over.

40:10.120 --> 40:10.880
You're dismissed.

40:23.480 --> 40:25.120
And if my cardio sucks?

40:25.400 --> 40:26.680
What if they corner me

40:26.840 --> 40:28.280
and I get wrecked again?

40:31.480 --> 40:32.080
Unbelievable...

40:51.280 --> 40:52.400
[What if they corner me]

40:52.400 --> 40:53.240
[and]

40:53.240 --> 40:54.680
[I get wrecked again?]

41:05.160 --> 41:05.760
[Drop the scissor.]

41:12.200 --> 41:12.840
[Seriously...]

41:13.880 --> 41:15.080
[come back to school.]

41:33.840 --> 41:35.320
Tofu, tofu,

41:36.680 --> 41:38.960
fresh and bold!

41:44.560 --> 41:46.760
Get it now before it's cold!

43:16.880 --> 43:17.480
Morning!

43:30.880 --> 43:31.400
Sup, stalker!

43:34.920 --> 43:35.400
Hey.

43:37.080 --> 43:37.960
Admit it,

43:38.280 --> 43:38.840
you're playing bodyguard.
